sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant DC as deep-chat
    participant JS as chat-bridge.js
    participant CPP as AiBridge (C++)
    participant AST as AgentStateTracker

    rect rgb(255, 255, 220)
        Note over User,CPP: USER RESETS OR CONFIG CHANGES
        User->>DC: Clicks reset button (or persona/model/provider/API key changes)
        DC->>JS: aiBridgeInterface.clearChat()
        JS->>CPP: aiBridge.clearChat()

        alt AiBridge is busy (reply in flight or RPC dispatch active)
            CPP->>CPP: set m_deferredClearChat = true
            Note over CPP: Deferred — will execute when onReplyFinished() completes
        else AiBridge is idle
            CPP->>CPP: stopStream()
            Note over CPP: disconnect + abort active HTTP reply
            CPP->>CPP: clearConversation()
            Note over CPP: m_conversation = []<br/>m_assistantDelta = {}<br/>m_toolCallAccum.clear()<br/>m_totalInputTokens = 0<br/>m_totalOutputTokens = 0
            CPP->>AST: clearAll() (reset workspace-change baseline)
            CPP-->>JS: emit onClearChat()
            JS->>JS: currentSignals = null
            JS->>DC: clearMessages()
            JS->>DC: addMessage("Starting up…")
            CPP->>CPP: sendIntroMessage()
            Note over CPP,DC: → triggers INTRO MESSAGE FLOW (see 01_intro_flow)
        end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over User,CPP: DEFERRED CLEAR (happens at end of onReplyFinished)
        Note over CPP: After tool-call loop completes or stream finishes:
        CPP->>CPP: check m_deferredClearChat
        CPP->>CPP: stopStream() + clearConversation() + emit onClearChat + sendIntroMessage
        Note over CPP: If tool calls were pending, they're discarded
    end
